# {{ project_name }}

pnpm + Turbo monorepo: NestJS API (modular monolith, kernel-only — modules are catalog
entries installed via `pnpm platform module add`) + headless React/Vite web (transport +
access guard only; UI kit is the product's choice), HTTP contract via Zod → OpenAPI →
generated Kubb client. Generated from `platform-template` — upstream changes arrive via
`copier update` (see [`docs/dev/template.md`](docs/dev/template.md)); a fix landing on an
installed catalog entry surfaces at session start via the pending-advisories hook.

**This file routes; it does not argue.** Every rule below is one line plus a link to
where it is decided. Detail belongs in the handbook or the ADR — never here.

